      "content": "i know i should seek help but i don't think anyone can actually help with this. it's not like a mental health thing... it's just who i am now. i've seen the faces of the people affected. it's like this permanent stain on my soul. how can anyone tell me to \"heal\" from something that fundamentally changed me into a monster?",
