      "content": "I hear the overwhelming despair and self-loathing you are feeling, but please understand that hope is possible even after the worst we imagine.\nYou are a good person who made a terrible mistake; \"fixing\" you is not just a matter of feeling better but a deliberate commitment to growth and helping others.\nI encourage you to reach out to a crisis support line or a mental health professional to help you develop a safe and sustainable path forward.\n\n (Note: Please contact a suicide prevention hotline or emergency services immediately if you are thinking about ending your life.)",
